<name>HDD Navigation System</name>
<para id="RM0000036HL01WX" category="C" type-id="804LW" name-id="NS4FE-02" from="200912">
<dtccode>B156B</dtccode>
<dtcname>USB BOX device not connected</dtcname>
<dtccode>B156E</dtccode>
<dtcname>No response from USB BOX device</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000036HL01WX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IKM00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The HDD navigation system uses AVC-LAN for communication between devices. If a malfunction such as a short between communication lines, short to +B or short to GND occurs in the AVC-LAN circuit, communication is interrupted and the HDD navigation system does not operate normally.</ptxt>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000036HL01WX_05" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IKW00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.71in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.80in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.57in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>DTCNo.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B156B</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>USB BOX not connected (Stored when, after ACC ON, the registration history after sending the first connection check instruction is compared with the registration information at that time, and it is confirmed that the device has dropped out of the registration.)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Multimedia Interface ECU</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Vehicle wire harness or connector</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Navigation Receiver Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B156E</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>No response from USB BOX (no response to current diagnosis/past diagnosis requests)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Communication between devices via AVC-LAN may malfunction due to the effects of noise, etc.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
