<ptxt>Pre-inspection Preparation</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector C of the navigation receiver assembly.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the multimedia interface computer.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the connector terminals of the vehicle wire harness between the navigation receiver assembly and multimedia interface computer.</ptxt>
